<title>PHILIPPINES: Filinvest Land Q1 net at 404 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Filinvest Land Q1 net at 404 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Filinvest Land Inc posted a net income of 404 million pesos in the first quarter of 1997, Fely Ramos, the company's first vice president, told stockholders on Friday.</p>
</text>
